        <AlertDescription>
          <p>You can modify the control plane node size in a running OpenShift Container Platform 4.22 cluster for the following configurations only:</p>
          <ul>
          <li>Clusters installed with a user-provisioned installation method.</li>
          <li>AWS clusters installed with an installer-provisioned infrastructure installation method.</li>
          <li>Clusters that use a control plane machine set to manage control plane machines.</li>
